{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boned Again: Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced pixel arena platformer</strong> where you fight endless waves of enemies as a fearless knight.<br>Battle through four unique locations \u2014 <strong>Abandoned Ruins, Underground Mines, Icy Wastelands, and Infernal Depths</strong> \u2014 each ruled by a powerful boss.<br><br><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Survive the Horde</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash through relentless waves of enemies, dodge attacks, and take down epic bosses in fast, skill-based battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.poster.avif?t=1765354693\" width=780 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.webm?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.mp4?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2728 Unlock Powerful Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to buy and upgrade dozens of <strong>active and passive abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique powers to create your own deadly combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.poster.avif?t=1765354693\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.webm?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.mp4?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Choose Your Upgrades</strong><br>Every level-up presents <strong>three upgrade cards</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe6 <i>Blue</i> \u2014 power up an active ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe9 <i>Green</i> \u2014 swap your equipped skills on the fly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfea <i>Purple</i> \u2014 enhance passive ability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely \u2014 every upgrade shapes your playstyle and survival.<br><i></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.poster.avif?t=1765354693\" width=780 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.webm?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.mp4?t=1765354693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Add the game to your wishlist to help it release faster!</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/c38o1y?t=1765354693\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Ability Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636480/399c344dc7da6bb98445577c614cf89d5f3f1642.jpg"},{"name":"First Boss Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636480/84a043c35254d933a